Because - Once your diety is no longer angry and your
timeout is down to zero the nastiness of the monster
stops mattering.  A dragon is enough points to cancel
anger or lots of timeout, but once you're seeing clovers
it stop matters.  To get an artifact a newt is as good as
a dragon.

So once you are reconciled eating the bigger monsters
mkaes the most sense because they give the most
nutrition and aren't any better than smaller ones.  While
still not reconciled it's a harder trade-off.  But all along
eating the monsters that are too slow to follow you to the
altar works well.

